Build a production-ready but cost-conscious SEO reporting bot for Google Cloud that does the following:

GOAL
- A Telegram bot that lets me run SEO checks on verified Google Search Console properties.
- I manage multiple websites.
- Every second day, the bot should rotate to the next site and run the check.
- The bot should generate a structured JSON report file.
- The bot should send a short summary message in Telegram with the JSON attached.
- The JSON will later be fed into an LLM by me to generate a client-facing PDF report.
- The system should be designed to stay as close to free-tier usage as possible.

TECH STACK
- Python
- Cloud Run
- Secret Manager
- Cloud Scheduler
- Google Search Console API
- Telegram Bot API
- Firestore or Cloud Storage for persistence
